# Rootless Docker needs these. Ubuntu 24.04 blocks unprivileged user namespaces
# via AppArmor, which breaks rootlesskit: relaxing it is a genuine (small)
# reduction in 24.04's default posture, made deliberately; the alternative is a
# per-binary AppArmor profile. The port floor lets a rootless daemon publish
# ports from 80 up.
